|---|---|---|
| 0:00:00–0:15:00 | cold block | thaw primers / dNTPs / buffer |
| 0:15:00–0:25:00 | bench | assemble master mix (polymerase in last) |
| 0:25:00–0:30:00 | bench | aliquot + add colonies |
