| 0:58:30–1:00:30 | bench | weigh agarose / TAE |
| 1:00:30–1:03:30 | microwave | dissolve agarose |
| 1:03:30–1:15:30 | bench | cool flask |
| 1:15:30–1:18:30 | bench | stain, pour, seat comb |
| 1:18:30–1:20:30 | gel rig | *fill rig with 1× TAE* |
| 1:18:30–1:53:30 | bench | **gel sets, 35 m** |
| 1:28:30–1:33:30 | bench | thaw + dye 100 bp ladder |
| 1:53:30–1:55:30 | bench | de-comb, gel into rig |
| 2:23:30–2:24:00 | microcentrifuge | spin PCR tubes |
| 2:24:00–2:29:00 | bench | add loading dye |
| 2:29:00–2:37:00 | bench | load 8 wells + ladder |
| 2:37:00–3:17:00 | gel rig | run at 120 V |
| 3:17:00–3:22:00 | transilluminator | image |
| 3:22:00–3:32:00 | bench | record + mark plate |

